Timo and I stand on the court.
Lena and Max stand on the other side.
The game begins.
Lena hits the shuttlecock high to me.
I run back quickly.
I hit it back hard and accurately.
The shuttlecock lands exactly in the corner.
Max cannot reach it.
Timo and I get a point.
Timo looks at me surprised.
He laughs cheerfully.
"You can play really well!" calls Timo.
We keep playing.
I really like running across the court.
We are a good team.
Lena and Max naturally want to win too.
They play very fast.
Max hits the shuttlecock directly to Timo.
Timo hits it back.
The four of us laugh a lot together.
